msgid "PRIVACY_POLICY_CONTENT"
msgstr ""
"[color=#b8cbc7]Updated: July 29, 2026 · Effective: July 29, 2026[/color]\n"
"\n"
"Welcome to Odd Spot (the “Game”). We value your privacy and process personal information lawfully, fairly, and only when necessary.\n"
"\n"
"[b][color=#e6b95c]1. Information we collect[/color][/b]\n"
"• Account data: email, username, display name, avatar URL, and sign-in credentials when you register or log in.\n"
"• Game data: level progress, challenge results, items, entitlements, preferences, and records required for synchronization.\n"
"• Device and log data: device type, operating system, app version, network status, crash logs, and a randomly generated installation identifier.\n"
"• Anonymous analytics: feature usage and performance data only when “Help improve the game” is enabled. It does not include your name, email, or game image content, and can be disabled at any time.\n"
"\n"
"[b][color=#e6b95c]2. How we use information[/color][/b]\n"
"We use information only to provide sign-in and progress sync, secure the service, diagnose issues, improve the Game, respond to requests, and meet legal obligations. We do not use personal information for personalized advertising without separate consent, and we do not sell personal information.\n"
"\n"
"[b][color=#e6b95c]3. Storage and security[/color][/b]\n"
"Data may be stored on servers operated by us or our service providers and retained only as long as needed for these purposes. Installation identifiers and access tokens are protected using one-way hashes or secure encryption. We use access controls, encrypted transmission, and audit logs, but no online service can guarantee absolute security.\n"
"\n"
"[b][color=#e6b95c]4. Sharing and disclosure[/color][/b]\n"
"We do not share personal information except with compliant providers necessary for cloud hosting or security operations, or when required by law or a lawful authority. Providers may process data only on our instructions and must protect its confidentiality.\n"
"\n"
"[b][color=#e6b95c]5. Children’s privacy[/color][/b]\n"
"Users under age 14 should use the Game only with a guardian’s consent and guidance. A guardian who believes a child submitted personal information without consent may contact us using the details below.\n"
"\n"
"[b][color=#e6b95c]6. Your rights[/color][/b]\n"
"You may review or correct account details, disable anonymous analytics, or contact us to request access, a copy, correction, deletion, or account closure. We may verify your identity before acting on a request. Legal exceptions may apply.\n"
"\n"
"[b][color=#e6b95c]7. Policy updates[/color][/b]\n"
"We may update this policy as features or laws change. We will provide a prominent in-game notice of material changes. The updated policy applies from its stated effective date.\n"
"\n"
"[b][color=#e6b95c]8. Contact us[/color][/b]\n"
"For questions, feedback, or privacy requests, email privacy@guaguatu.com. After verifying your identity, we will respond within the period required by applicable law."

